    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/411a706e0d004d506821b96f00957fe2.avif?t=1741865933\" width=576 height=65 /></span>Discover unique ice cream-making techniques, themes, and customers from various cultures.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/150a64f275519ce646ccac8a1731c289.poster.avif?t=1741865933\" width=574 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/150a64f275519ce646ccac8a1731c289.webm?t=1741865933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/150a64f275519ce646ccac8a1731c289.mp4?t=1741865933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/3701be6b52300ae74a1da788d1a4d14d.avif?t=1741865933\" width=576 height=65 /></span><br>Master the art of making <strong>traditional Matka Kulfi, Thai rolled ice cream, Japanese Mochi,</strong> or <strong>classic cups and cones.</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/35d21eba30575dde30ca9c8d018959da.poster.avif?t=1741865933\" width=574 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/35d21eba30575dde30ca9c8d018959da.webm?t=1741865933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/35d21eba30575dde30ca9c8d018959da.mp4?t=1741865933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u00a0 </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/e42c3b932b17c4e723db428b71799f41.avif?t=1741865933\" width=576 height=65 /></span>Personalize your store\u2019s <strong>furniture, decor, and aesthetics</strong> to match your vision and style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/9a0ca69589210a319e6cf758e4bcfcf5.poster.avif?t=1741865933\" width=574 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/9a0ca69589210a319e6cf758e4bcfcf5.webm?t=1741865933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/9a0ca69589210a319e6cf758e4bcfcf5.mp4?t=1741865933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/1e61500433114c4c736357c62f4353b5.avif?t=1741865933\" width=576 height=65 /></span>Maintain a spotless shop to ensure customer satisfaction and a welcoming atmosphere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/39ce408c3f8cf6074052fc6916f39167.poster.avif?t=1741865933\" width=574 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/39ce408c3f8cf6074052fc6916f39167.webm?t=1741865933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/39ce408c3f8cf6074052fc6916f39167.mp4?t=1741865933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/1e0a3804f3d56a4a3b69a0085d30faa9.avif?t=1741865933\" width=576 height=65 /></span><br>Create your own <strong>menu, set prices, hire staff,</strong> and make strategic choices to build a thriving and profitable ice cream empire!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/8e3415a2d7ade33d73f8e21270718430.poster.avif?t=1741865933\" width=574 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/8e3415a2d7ade33d73f8e21270718430.webm?t=1741865933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515530/extras/8e3415a2d7ade33d73f8e21270718430.mp4?t=1741865933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br></p>",
